{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Pirates is a swashbuckling roguelike turn-based RPG about adventuring on the high seas. Danger and excitement. Risk and reward.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/da11f0dcfe728e2404d3b2f10b9fc7e5.poster.avif?t=1760373928\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/da11f0dcfe728e2404d3b2f10b9fc7e5.webm?t=1760373928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/da11f0dcfe728e2404d3b2f10b9fc7e5.mp4?t=1760373928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your Pirate Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a team of brave and skilled pirates to crew your ship.\u00a0 Chart your course and explore shipwrecks and treasure islands.\u00a0 Challenge other pirates, legendary captains and even Lovecraftian inspired sea monsters in an effort to claim both treasure and increase your status as a pirate legend.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/76e1f995766a14817bba525330c1a94b.poster.avif?t=1760373928\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/76e1f995766a14817bba525330c1a94b.webm?t=1760373928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/76e1f995766a14817bba525330c1a94b.mp4?t=1760373928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Wide Variety of character classes with diverse skillsets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirate Legends System that allows your heroes to increase their legendary status</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds where charting the right course means balancing risk vs reward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each roguelike style voyage is broken up into passages, where a boss awaits at the end of each passage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/0fe2432b984d4dddbd6a714357ac8cc4.poster.avif?t=1760373928\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/0fe2432b984d4dddbd6a714357ac8cc4.webm?t=1760373928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/extras/0fe2432b984d4dddbd6a714357ac8cc4.mp4?t=1760373928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rogue Pirates your goal is to become a Pirate Legend. Can you successfully captain your crew through uncharted waters, navigating a hostile sea filled with both peril and plunder?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445680?t=1760373928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445680?t=1760373928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/b9f8f67e45215229147b91d5fdd4dec9fa09797f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760373928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445680/b9f8f67e45215229147b91d5fdd4dec9fa09797f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760373928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},